Josh OS Stage 0 Live

The graphical session should start automatically on tty1.
For diagnostics, use Ctrl+Alt+F2; return to tty1 with Ctrl+Alt+F1.

Internet and Wi-Fi diagnostics:
  josh-wifi status
  josh-wifi list
  josh-wifi connect "Your SSID"
  josh-network-check

josh-wifi connect prompts securely for the Wi-Fi password.
josh-network-check verifies NetworkManager, DNS, NTP time, CA certificates,
routing, and a real HTTPS/TLS connection to https://www.youtube.com/.
